      "description": "The generic app-service route. Resolved against config/resources.json: standard ABP CRUD is derived from the resource's storage, anything else is a named behaviour. A service the registry does not describe falls through to the upstream, so this never swallows an endpoint it cannot serve. Exact entries above outrank it.",
